  "contentval": "0003Jzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dSQv/205",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">자유학기 수업때</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;스마트폰 어플을 활용한 아두이노 수업 16차시 글을 재과만에 작성</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">했습니다.</span></p><p><a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dSQv/99\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dSQv/99</span></a><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">많은 선생님들의 문의가 있었고, 업체홍보가 되는거 같아 2년간 비밀댓글 및 메일로 알려드렸습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">2년이 지나는 동안 업체에서 스마트폰 어플 및 키트가 새롭게 업데이트 된것이 많았습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">이에 최근 1달간 문의를 남기신 선생님들께, 게시글로 작성하여 안내드린다는게 늦어졌습니다. 양해부탁드립니다.^^</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">현재 저는 중학교에서 고등학교로 학교를 옮겨서 근무중이라, SW 동아리 지도하면서 활동한 내용을 소개합니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">자유학기 주제선택 수업때 활용이 가능할것은 저는 고등학교 동아리 활동으로 변형했습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">블록코딩을 활용한 아두이노를 학습하는 형태라, 중학교 수준에는 더 잘 맞습니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">하지만 코로나-19로 인하여 동아리 활동 및 모둠활동이 제한되고, 특히 고1과 고2가 격주로 등교하여 동아리활동이 정상적으로 운영이 어렵습니다. 그리하여 아래처럼 활동을 하고 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">설명이 길었는데, 활동한 내용 봐주시면 됩니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">(제 블로그에도 동일내용 작성되어 있습니다.&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/nojeeho/222030948464\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">https://blog.naver.com/nojeeho/222030948464</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ce7002ea-eea9-4f8d-993f-4e968a109066\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size:12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><div class=\"se-component-content\" style=\"margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-6c4154e3-2f04-4ea8-b942-07ab83f76f8a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7c9c100a-57fd-420e-ab0d-8ae11e9d5bf2\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">코로나 19로 인해,  고등학교에서는 고1과 고2가 격주로 등교하고 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-a39ca3b9-1693-42f3-a565-b54c5e904d1e\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-18db3103-5f66-4eb0-9c5d-f10e84f50ffb\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">대부분의 고등학교에서는 고1과 고2가 한 동아리 편성이 되어 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-c2c10497-eb47-498c-b14c-5706adae7626\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e1b835b0-93d8-40ce-826c-101ea850982e\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(고3이 1학기에 수시마감이 하기에, 고3만 별도로 동아리가 운영이 됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-6e90624d-26ef-4b11-bb3c-e39ce89923da\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6a42b8ee-ef45-415b-a992-93a01162e1f3\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">이에, 격주등교하는 현 상황에서는 고1, 고2 동아리활동이 정상적으로 진행이 어려운 상황입니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-8d64e44d-7591-44d3-8433-ff2de3e2270b\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1c6d0e30-bc70-441d-8c36-7c74f4b7476d\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-d5e01d92-1ba8-41a6-90b8-d7fee6132b85\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ecd8e55f-87ae-403d-8120-f8efb10a9bc8\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 24px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">제가 지도하는 SW 동아리에서 실시한 활동을 소개합니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-4d1431e6-6978-4496-8f80-294fed3bfbf9\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0a8c23e8-3e28-4277-ad4f-938df490e264\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(활동사진은 글 아래에 일괄적으로 올렸습니다)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-4fe3e571-4b37-4b42-aae4-1b64edbd371a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-72721f30-3617-4445-9da2-cd4782140934\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-0ee5d966-4b0f-4c2d-b36f-4df921b01714\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b68fba1f-d0d8-4722-951c-72abeefc09fa\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">7월 1일(수) 고3이 하교한 7교시에, 고1 학생들이 등교하여 </span><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-343f69b2-9d15-4b03-b807-93010c06c2af\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">고2학생들과 동아리</span><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7f8117ad-d716-4385-9a49-2982bc9a0e60\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">활동을에 하였습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-3a615ac9-4683-43c2-a4db-228c936a74d1\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-156bc6f1-8d6d-4142-89ed-f4d03ab162a6\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(이는 고1과 고2가 첫 대면하는 시간이었고, 1학기의 마지막 대면시간이었습니다. 학교차원에서 고1 등교가 진행했습니다.)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-89b1d94a-996f-4df3-9e78-c7d80ef38d7f\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-20435c64-53b7-432c-81de-6a6ad8431012\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b13bf7cf-514b-4f4d-b2ef-3aaf3b7bb040\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e77615d2-9727-40a1-bd31-3969f72add16\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">문제는 고2 학생들이 고1학생은 SW 수준이 어떤지 모른 상태에서 동아리가 진행되었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-93c682ac-05f1-4ca8-b2f6-1c6ed9dcf8f3\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-671b8d74-caf3-4a2f-8e6e-74618d46fa4a\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(직접 대면한적이 이전에는 없기에, 파악이 불가능했습니다.)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-4d391fdf-1216-4a10-b565-ab7c0fb7930c\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-83b73650-54bc-4ff9-af67-440c986ef2fb\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-2762f7b5-8219-498e-8971-6999167cc99c\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1ab33ba0-e074-4cf4-80ce-abc10f2afde3\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">이에 고2 학생들이  </span><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-67db15e6-694f-410e-b8fa-6d044f319a39\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">메이크 어플</span></span><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8f1b2214-f326-4d9e-bfc6-de2dbcffc95e\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">을 활용해서 고1 학생들이 블록코딩을 어떻게 하는지 확인 및 안내했습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-182e7848-32be-40da-9bd7-4552b47d83aa\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7090d6fd-6681-49af-832e-0e45d3be521b\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">고1 학생들이 메이클 어플내 미션완료시간과 코딩블록 사용갯수를 통해 컴퓨팅 사고력을 동아리 부장과 차장이 파악하였습니다. </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-5ee64d94-8d0b-4955-a457-9084a665f87a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5a95f9e6-52d7-4de9-b128-954c6ed6b83b\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">이처럼 별도의 기자재없이 학생들이 가지고 있는 스마트폰을 활용해 SW 활동을 학생들 스스로 할수 있었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-bf0107d5-d4bc-4d09-b3ca-852ba0f375be\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e6aaf73c-c389-47ad-8e56-a79a468e58ad\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-6bcc8dfb-1201-42b4-93ce-c00230e6d2cc\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5e62df78-334a-4fba-8a6f-3f43f7d0c31c\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-35b20f6e-165a-414a-b4e9-562d8c0349cc\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3366c4d4-8e5d-4210-ae17-ad11f8e5689d\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">2학년 동아리 부장들은 1학년 학생 중 가장 실력이 우수한 이를 1학년의 부장과 차장으로 선발해서, 1학년 끼리 동아리 활동이 진행될수 있도록 안내했습니다.(7월 8일에는 1학년만 등교해서 동아리활동을 하였습니다.)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-2420da90-2313-4ed3-9f02-373df4a70836\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-513584c9-df8d-4a00-b9b5-05a979028df2\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-a08f550d-1b02-4c40-b909-0e9b1e4e2e7c\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-13b1cb1a-d5f0-48be-a5a6-6043b9fa6bda\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-39307d23-8310-4cd7-bc06-54d6ba82476a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-621f67f0-b9b8-40f4-8a9b-0a900d082d72\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">&#9733; 메이크 어플을 사용하니, 코로나 19로  인하여 온라인수업기간에도 동아리 활동이 가능했습니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-69500009-8abb-4693-a446-c39a04410c7a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b8d45415-2a2f-4f15-811e-289fe0d8303c\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">그리고 학교현실상 컴퓨터실등 여러명이 같은 기기를 접촉하거나, 모둠활동이 제한되는 상황해서, 개개인이 가진 스마트폰으로 SW교육이 이루어지는게 가장 큰 장점이었습니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b0206092-4d5e-44d7-9f88-2843ed08f9c9\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ed0f54b7-8ce3-4ade-ad3f-bcd19423d58a\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-77ca744f-89ac-4339-9c4e-f464cf0e8a9b\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs-fs19 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f41fa4bd-d8f9-4be5-a87c-87fc20fb290b\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">&#9733;다음은 7/8(수) 1학년만 등교해서 참여하여, 메이크 어플과 키트를 활용한 활동을 작성하겠습니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-921cd249-9e30-4b26-8e56-d137a4294e11\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5a5f1222-54e7-43e6-8abd-a6117768fc22\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-2fa55d16-78a7-4922-b020-98c2cf6961a6\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size:12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\" style=\"margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/PostView.nhn?blogId=nojeeho&amp;logNo=222030948464&amp;categor